---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="找不到这一页 | 宛瑜的小窝"
  description="这一页好像走丢了。"
>
  <div class="not-found container-content">
    <p class="not-found__code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
    <h1 class="not-found__title">这一页好像走丢了</h1>
    <p class="not-found__text">
      可能是地址打错了，也可能是我前几天整理东西，把它挪到别的地方去了。
    </p>
    <a class="not-found__back" href="/">回首页慢慢看 →</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 56vh;
    padding-block: calc(4rem + 3rem) 5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .not-found__code {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 12vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-brand);
    opacity: 0.28;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .not-found__title {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .not-found__text {
    max-width: 30rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .not-found__back {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-brand);
    color: var(--color-surface);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      transform 0.25s ease,
      box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .not-found__back:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover);
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .not-found__back {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
